  "body": "Performance/scaling follow-up to the live ACTION_REQUIRED visibility fix.\n\n- Adds one read-only `/api/listings/action-required` endpoint backed by a lightweight projection with bot id/name and the listing fields needed by the UI.\n- Adds `/api/listings/action-required/count` using a direct status count.\n- Action-required page now performs one request per 15s refresh instead of `getBots + one request per bot`.\n- Sidebar warning count no longer polls the full dashboard stats calculation.\n- Existing per-bot action-required API stays available for compatibility.\n- Background polling remains hidden-tab aware and coalesced.\n\nThis keeps negotiated offers visible while making polling independent of bot count. No negotiation decisions, price thresholds, quota, sessions, scheduling, or mutation endpoints change.",
